Z||000000||RICK||02-14-2000||09:41 PM||||St. Louis Fiero Club is having another car show this year, it's Saturday, April 29th from 9am to 4pm.  If anyone is interested I have more details, just ask.  I'd be willing to house a few people at my place to help with the cost (so you don't have to pay for a hotel)since most everybody does not live around here.<BR>rick||||reg||7
