Z||000004||BBBAD GT||02-15-2000||09:32 AM||||I'll be there.  Since St. Louis is closer to me than Huntsville (Ed Parks show), I'll be attending the St. Louie event.  It'll be nice to actually meet people who know what kind of car we drive (if I only had a nickle for everytime somebody says "whats is that?")<BR>I'd also like to see what different mods people have made, since mine is so BBBONE stock  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/fiero1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/fiero1.jpg</A> <P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||HF6582||02-15-2000||11:09 AM||||Last year they had about 20-30 cars there.<BR>One engine swap car SC3800 that the owner did everything himself. A lot of stories and a good time for every one that showed up.<P>Kind of sounds like I'm putting a plug in for the club.<P>This year I plan on going to the swap meet so I will not be there.  Unless plans change.<P>Scott||||reg||1
